    6 function_definition: return_types fun_declarator compound_statement
    7                    | return_types fun_declarator SEMICOLON

    8 declaration: return_types SEMICOLON
    9            | return_types init_declarator_list SEMICOLON

   10 return_types: declaration_specifiers

