  172 enumerator: IDENTIFIER
  173           | IDENTIFIER ASSIGN constant_expression

  174 pointer: STAR
  175        | STAR CONST
  176        | STAR pointer
  177        | BIT_AND

  178 type_name: specifier_qualifier_list

  179 statement: labeled_statement
